{
"#useparam"
:
true
,
"#name"
:
{
"x telegram"
:
null
,
"zh"
:
"使用 Telegram 群机器人发送消息"
,
"en"
:
"Send messages using a Telegram group bot"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"使用 x telegram 向你的 Telegram 群或频道发送消息。首次使用需要配置群机器人的 token。"
,
"en"
:
"Use x telegram send messages to your Telegram group or channel. The first use requires configuring bot token."
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"zh"
:
"群机器人（x telegram bot）\n用于向群聊或频道发送单向通知，例如 CI/CD 构建通知、服务器监控告警\n首次使用需要配置 bot token\n配置命令：x telegram --cfg token=<token>\nToken 获取指引: https://core.telegram.org/bots#how-do-i-create-a-bot\n"
,
"en"
:
"Group Bot (x telegram bot)\nUse case: One-way notifications to groups/channels, e.g., CI/CD build notifications, server monitoring alerts\nFirst-time setup requires bot token\nConfiguration command: x telegram --cfg token=<token>\nSetup guide: https://core.telegram.org/bots#how-do-i-create-a-bot\n"
}
,
{
"zh"
:
"接入 x claw 作为私人 AI 助手：\n1. 配置 bot token\n2. 启动 Telegram 网关服务：x telegram bot service start\n3. 启动 x claw 接入 Telegram: x claw start --telegram\n"
,
"en"
:
"Integrate with x claw as private AI assistant:\n1. Configure bot token\n2. Start Telegram gateway service: x telegram bot service start\n3. Start x claw with Telegram: x claw start --telegram\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x telegram init"
,
"zh"
:
"交互模式初始化配置"
,
"en"
:
"Initialize configuration in interactive mode"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x telegram --cfg token=<token>"
,
"zh"
:
"设置群机器人的 token"
,
"en"
:
"Set the group bot's token"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x telegram send --text \"x-cmd v1.0 released successfully\""
,
"zh"
:
"发送文本消息到 Telegram 群"
,
"en"
:
"Send text type messages to Telegram group"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x telegram send --text --chatid \"@channelusername\" \"x-cmd v1.0 released successfully\""
,
"zh"
:
"发送文本消息到 Telegram 频道"
,
"en"
:
"Send text type messages to Telegram channel"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x telegram send --image --chatid \"-967810017\" --file_path ./a.png"
,
"zh"
:
"发送 a.png 图片到 Telegram 群"
,
"en"
:
"Send a.png images to Telegram group"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x telegram bot service start"
,
"zh"
:
"启动 Telegram 网关服务"
,
"en"
:
"Start Telegram gateway service"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x telegram bot service status"
,
"zh"
:
"查看网关服务状态"
,
"en"
:
"Show gateway service status"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x telegram bot service log"
,
"zh"
:
"查看网关服务日志"
,
"en"
:
"Show gateway service log"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x telegram bot service stop"
,
"zh"
:
"停止网关服务"
,
"en"
:
"Stop gateway service"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:config"
:
[
"init"
,
"--cfg"
,
"--cur"
]
,
"send"
:
{
"#subcmd:Multimedia"
:
[
"--file"
,
"--image"
,
"--video"
,
"--audio"
,
"--voice"
,
"--animation"
,
"--video_note"
]
,
